rts at two bases, never stored\", :kinds #{:var :section :schema}, k 10, no vector): one seon.ctx.search/search costs 8.7M ticks and 25 MB, of which seon.ctx.search/relevance 4.8M (seon.doc/terms tokenizing the 40 pool items' texts, 134k characters, 2.5M; item-te)."
